When that error occurs you can try setting the tolerance to a lower value using the toler argument. So you would write something like:

outputGWAS<-userGWAS(

        covstruc=LDSCoutput,

        SNPs=SNP,

        estimation="DWLS",

        model=model,

        sub =c("C~SNP","NC~SNP"),

       toler=1e-30)

